Flow:
```
final snapshot = await load();
final hash = fingerprint(snapshot);
final now = clock();
if (hash == store.hash && store.file.isNotEmpty) { store.lastCheck = now.ms; return skipped; }
// write
final name = fileNameFor(now);
final tmp = await writer.write(snapshot, name); // creates zip at temp path
try {
  await target.publish(tmp, name);
} catch (e) {
  // keep old, don't update hash; maybe delete tmp
  return failed;
}
// delete old
for (final old in await target.listExisting()) if (old != name && old.startsWith('gongzhuriji_')) await target.delete(old); // also delete store.file if different
store.hash = hash; store.at = now.ms; store.file = name; store.lastCheck = now.ms;
```
Also on failure delete tmp. Important: "先写新文件成功，再删旧文件". If publish succeeds but old deletion fails → still update store, but old remains; best effort.

